     ["Deconstruct modern web architectures (SPA, REST APIs, microservices)", "Inspect client-side source code, JavaScript bundles, and DOM storage in DevTools", "Configure an intercepting HTTP proxy (Burp Suite / OWASP ZAP)", "Intercept, inspect, and modify HTTP requests and responses in real-time"],
